  "body": "This is a rare opportunity to secure a prime, 1,287sqm (approx), freehold site overlooking Big Manly Beach. This elevated property offers expansive sea views and is located in a highly sought after area where properties are tightly held.\r\n\r\nRemove the existing bach to build your dream coastal retreat or explore subdivision possibilities for two dwellings (subject to council approval), the potential here is significant. Concept designs for an architecturally designed family home are already available for your review.\r\n\r\nThe property is perfectly situated within walking distance of the beach, local parks, and Manly Village. Due to a change in circumstances, the current owners must sell, making this a unique opening for a new buyer.\r\n\r\nPlease contact me to arrange a private viewing and discuss how you can make this property yours.",
